                                [4] = "(4 items) Adds 1096 Maximum Magicka",
                                [5] = "(5 items) When you heal yourself or an ally with an ability, gain a Warming Aura for |cffffff10|r seconds. While in the Warming Aura, you and group members restore |cffffff1014|r Health every |cffffff2|r seconds and reduce the cost of Sprint, Block, and Roll Dodge by |cffffff5|r%. This effect can occur once every |cffffff12|r seconds and the heal scales off the higher of your Max Magicka or Stamina.",
